.TH mnnn-migrate 1  "mnnn-migrate 2.22.3" 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH NAME
mnnn\-migrate \- Move code from before 2.23 into code spaces: one space per code (named as the code; taken: NAME\-migration; both taken: skipped), its kind inferred, and stored pipelines\*(Aq code: steps rewritten to space:. Offered, never automatic; safe to run again
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmnnn migrate\fR [\fB\-\-home\fR] [\fB\-\-kind\fR] [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-rewrite\-pipelines\fR] [\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-backup\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-log\-file\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-y\fR|\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR] [\fB\-\-transport\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fICODES\fR] 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH DESCRIPTION
Move code from before 2.23 into code spaces: one space per code (named as the code; taken: NAME\-migration; both taken: skipped), its kind inferred, and stored pipelines\*(Aq code: steps rewritten to space:. Offered, never automatic; safe to run again
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-home\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Muninn home directory (default ~/.muninn)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_HOME\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-kind\fR \fI<KIND>\fR
The kind for code whose kind is unclear
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
parser
.IP \(bu 2
transform
.IP \(bu 2
analysis
.IP \(bu 2
ingest\-connector
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Database file (default <home>/storage/muninn.database)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_DB\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Show the report; change nothing
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-rewrite\-pipelines\fR
Leave stored pipelines\*(Aq code: steps as they are
.TP
\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR
Never prompt; missing values are errors
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_NON_INTERACTIVE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-backup\fR
Don\*(Aqt write the backup first
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
More output (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-log\-file\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Write logs to this file instead of stderr (the TUI defaults to <home>/logs/tui.log)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_LOG_FILE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Print nothing but errors and requested data
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_QUIET\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Answer yes to every confirmation
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_YES\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR \fI<THEME_MODE>\fR
Override the theme mode for this run
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
light
.IP \(bu 2
dark
.IP \(bu 2
system
.RE
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_THEME_MODE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-transport\fR \fI<stream|poll>\fR
How live collaboration reaches peers: `stream` (gRPC streams, the default) or `poll` (requests over the peer connection; for containers). Overrides MUNINN_COLLAB_TRANSPORT and the `net config \-\-collab\-transport` setting
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fICODES\fR]
Only these codes (default: every code in no space)
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH VERSION
v2.22.3
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBmnnn\fR(1)
